{{> Start this}}

{{> Logo this}}

{{> EmailTitle title=(t "Verify Your New Email Address") }}

{{!--
  Sent to an account's new address when the address was written straight
  away - by a master admin, the organization's identity provider through
  SCIM, or another write OneUptime makes - so the new address is proven
  before it signs in (UserService.onUpdateSuccess, sent by Common's
  EmailChangeConfirmation.sendVerificationOfNewAddress). A person's own
  change waits for its link instead (ConfirmEmailChange) and sends this
  never.

  It says who made the change, by role and never by name, as the email to
  the address the account left does (#9907, #10157,
  Types/Accounts/EmailAddressChangedEmail): a server admin, the
  organization's identity provider, the person themselves (a master admin's
  own change), or nobody named. Then when, in the reader's time zone, and
  the button that verifies the address. In the language on the account.

  The product's name goes into a sentence through ttHtml, which escapes the
  whole sentence; the time is a value. Everything else is OneUptime's own
  words, looked up in the reader's language (Utils/EmailLanguage.ts).
--}}

{{#if changedByServerAdmin}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(ttHtml "A server admin made this the email address of your {{product}} account." product=(brandName))}}
{{else if changedByIdentityProvider}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(ttHtml "Your organization's identity provider made this the email address of your {{product}} account." product=(brandName))}}
{{else if changedByAccountOwner}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(ttHtml "You made this the email address of your {{product}} account." product=(brandName))}}
{{else}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(ttHtml "This is now the email address of your {{product}} account." product=(brandName))}}
{{/if}}

{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "Verify it with the button below. Until you do, signing in with this address asks you to verify it first.")}}

{{#if changedAt}}
{{> DetailBoxStart this }}
{{> DetailBoxField title=(t "Changed at:") plainText=changedAt }}
{{> DetailBoxEnd this }}
{{/if}}

{{> ButtonBlock buttonUrl=tokenVerifyUrl buttonText=(t "Verify Email")}}

{{> VerticalSpace this}}

{{> LinkBlock linkUrl=tokenVerifyUrl linkLabel=(t "You can also copy and paste this link:")}}

{{#if changedByIdentityProvider}}
{{> InfoBlock info=(tHtml "If you did not expect this, contact your organization's admin.")}}
{{/if}}

{{> SupportBlock this }}

{{> Footer this}}

{{> End this}}
